OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy start, with outbreaks of
OL,6,Frain sinking south across Wales.
OL,7,FTurning drier and brighter by mid-
OL,8,Fmorning with sunny spells and isolated
OL,9,Fshowers, mostly in the west. Staying
OL,10,Fwarm but much less humid than in
OL,11,Frecent days.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers continuing in places
OL,14,Fwithin the northwesterly breeze, gusty
OL,15,Faround coastal areas. Turning cloudier
OL,16,Fovernight, feeling cooler than
OL,17,Fprevious nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
